              "content": "Shows the number of support cases that match the Case Classification (CC) requirements in the targeted sources.<br /><br /><details><summary>Privilege required</summary>\n```\n{\"owner\":\"COVEO_ML\",\"targetDomain\":\"ALLOW_CONTENT_PREVIEW\",\"type\":\"ENABLE\",\"targetId\":\"*\"}\n```\n</details>",
